Z||000007||Raydar||12-02-2001||10:12 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by malacite:<BR><B>Just looking for some opinions on this car.<P>...454/turbo 400 combo with headers leading to full length chrome sidepipes<P>Chrome Centerline Auto/Drag wheels...<BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I'd go with an LT4 an LS5 or some other small block, and a reworked 700R4. <BR>Being the practical type of guy that I am. <P>I also might choose something other than Auto/Drags. <BR>Cragar had a wheel called an SP200, I think. It's a standard five spoke mag, but the spokes are kind of "fat". Does that make any sense? <P>Anyway, that's just me. It would be hard to build a 70 (or 71 or 72) Chevelle that I <I>didn't</I> like.<P><P>------------------<BR>Raydar<BR><FONT SIZE="1"><BR>From the Department of Redundancy Department.</FONT>||||reg||1
